    {
      "Text": "Security update for ignition",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for ignition fixes the following issues\n\n- CVE-2026-39821: golang.org/x/net/idna: failure to reject ASCII-only Punycode-encoded labels allows for validation\n  bypass and privilege escalation (bsc#1266606).\n- CVE-2026-56852: golang.org/x/text/unicode/norm: handling of input containing invalid UTF-8 bytes can lead to infinite\n  loop (bsc#1272059).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
